flowchart TD
    A[Borrower presents ID card and book] --> B[Staff checks or scans ID]
    B --> C{Borrower and book eligible?}
    C -- No --> D[Explain issue and follow library policy]
    C -- Yes --> E[Issue record step - exact method unknown]
    E --> F[Staff writes due date on book]
    F --> G[Borrower leaves and remembers date]
    G --> H[Book returned at counter]
    H --> I[Staff checks book and records return - assumed]
    I --> J[Issue closed]
